            "sid": "HEB 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi meno, wun utmegina maleŋ ma Lubaŋa olwoŋowu kacel kweda, koŋ wutam lok i kom Yecu ma en lakwana dok ajwaka madit me niye ma wan watuco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.12.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 12.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " En obedo lagen bot Lubaŋa muyero okete i tic, ma rom aroma ki Moses ma yam obedo lagen i ot pa Lubaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lager ot gimiye deyo madit makato ot; kit meno Yecu bene nene gikwano ni deyone dit kato pa Moses woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien ot mo keken dano aye ma gero, ento ŋat ma gero jami ducu en aye Lubaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses yam obedo lagen i ot pa Lubaŋa ducu macalo latic, pi miyo caden i lok ma gibiloko i kare ma lacen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Kricito obedo lagen i kom ot pa Lubaŋa macalo Wode. Wan aye wa ode ka ce wamoko matek i tekcwinywa, ki i wakkewa pi gen ma watye kwede.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
